# Only research software is a chublet (Florian, paper revision, 2026-11-02).
# The 22 host programs, programming languages and platforms that 2026-10-23-chublets-everywhere.qs made chublets are no chublets any more.
# They stay in the model as items: 268 statements point at them (P123 programmed in, P109 depends on software). Only P2 -> Q106 goes.
# That file stays as it was applied; this one reverses its 22 lines. The importers never wrote P2 -> Q106 for these items (hand rows, empty origin),
# so a reimport does not bring it back.
# Result: 420 chublets = 414 open-archaeo entries + 6 Wikidata seeds (416 entries minus Alligator and profileAAR, which are the seeds Q359 and Q361 after the merges).
